WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.094
Hello! Who are you?

2
00:00:12.095 --> 00:00:16.428
I'm a hippopotamus.

3
00:00:16.429 --> 00:00:21.185
Many people just call us hippos.

4
00:00:21.186 --> 00:00:25.962
We're very big land mammals.

5
00:00:25.963 --> 00:00:29.235
Where do you live?

6
00:00:29.236 --> 00:00:32.715
Hippos live in Africa.

7
00:00:32.716 --> 00:00:38.204
We stay near swamps, lakes, and rivers.

8
00:00:38.205 --> 00:00:41.814
Do you like the water?

9
00:00:41.815 --> 00:00:47.470
Yes. Hippos spend almost all day in the water.

10
00:00:47.471 --> 00:00:51.115
The water keeps us cool.

11
00:00:51.116 --> 00:00:55.280
We even sleep in shallow water.

12
00:00:55.281 --> 00:00:59.443
Are you a good swimmer?

13
00:00:59.444 --> 00:01:04.963
Hippos are very heavy.

14
00:01:04.964 --> 00:01:08.637
We don't float.

15
00:01:08.638 --> 00:01:13.207
So we often just walk through the water.

16
00:01:13.208 --> 00:01:16.202
What do you eat?

17
00:01:16.203 --> 00:01:20.149
Hippos eat grasses.

18
00:01:20.150 --> 00:01:25.399
We usually wait until the hot sun sets.

19
00:01:25.400 --> 00:01:30.067
Then we leave the water to find food.

20
00:01:30.068 --> 00:01:38.663
You have a huge mouth!

21
00:01:38.664 --> 00:01:44.376
Our jaws can open very wide.

22
00:01:44.377 --> 00:01:49.502
Our bottom teeth are long—and sharp!

23
00:01:49.503 --> 00:01:54.924
We use them to fight.

24
00:01:54.925 --> 00:01:59.577
Oh! Do you have many enemies?

25
00:01:59.578 --> 00:02:04.168
We're too big to have many enemies.

26
00:02:04.169 --> 00:02:14.909
But people often hunt us.

27
00:02:14.910 --> 00:02:18.221
I'm getting hot again.

28
00:02:18.222 --> 00:02:22.382
Back in the water!

29
00:02:22.383 --> 00:02:30.374
Bye, Hippopotamus!

